## 1. Start at 12 V / 0.5 A (startup.csv, 200 Hz): CC (mode 0) for 334 ms at 0.497-0.498 A, Vout sagging to ~9.3-11.8 V, then CV; steady 11.998 V / 0.323 A after 2 s.
